    {
      "id": "lake-below-p1",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": {
        "zhHans": [
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": "起初，钓鱼像是在为木屋补充普通物件；很快，湖里被拉上来的东西开始偏离常识。《逃离方块：锈湖湖畔》 由此把“湖”从背景变成会主动回应玩家的空间。"
          }
        ],
        "en": [
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": "At first, fishing seems to supply ordinary objects for the cabin. Soon the things pulled from the water stop behaving like ordinary catches, turning the lake from scenery into a space that seems to answer the player."
          }
        ]
      },
      "spoiler": {
        "level": "minor",
        "requiredCompletedGameIds": [],
        "allowManualReveal": true
      },
      "provenance": {
        "mode": "editorial-summary",
        "sourceIds": [
          "primary-the-lake-game",
          "editorial-rla"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "lake-below-p2",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": {
        "zhHans": [
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": "一具不应出现在钓线另一端的人形存在，把这种不安推到极点。它与后来出现的 "
          },
          {
            "kind": "entity",
            "entity": {
              "type": "character",
              "id": "corrupted-soul"
            },
            "label": "腐化灵魂"
          },
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": " 意象相互呼应，让“钓起物品”的动作第一次明显带上了人物与记忆的重量。"
          }
        ],
        "en": [
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": "A humanlike presence where no such catch should be pushes the unease much further. It echoes the later "
          },
          {
            "kind": "entity",
            "entity": {
              "type": "character",
              "id": "corrupted-soul"
            },
            "label": "Corrupted Soul"
          },
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": " imagery, giving the act of pulling objects from the lake a new weight tied to people and memory."
          }
        ]
      },
      "spoiler": {
        "level": "major",
        "requiredCompletedGameIds": [],
        "allowManualReveal": true
      },
      "provenance": {
        "mode": "editorial-summary",
        "sourceIds": [
          "primary-the-lake-game",
          "editorial-rla"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "lake-below-p3",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": {
        "zhHans": [
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": "与此同时，木屋里分散的物件逐渐被组织到同一个中心结构上。探索不再只是“找到出口”，而是把湖中取得的东西组合成一次具有仪式感的准备。"
          }
        ],
        "en": [
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": "Meanwhile, objects scattered through the cabin begin to converge on one central structure. The exploration stops feeling like a simple search for an exit and becomes preparation for something ritual-like."
          }
        ]
      },
      "spoiler": {
        "level": "minor",
        "requiredCompletedGameIds": [],
        "allowManualReveal": true
      },
      "provenance": {
        "mode": "editorial-summary",
        "sourceIds": [
          "primary-the-lake-game",
          "editorial-rla"
        ]
      }
    },
